# Regenerable simulated data and plots -- see README.md for the exact
# commands that produce them. Real captures go in traces/real/ (power) and
# traces/timing/ (timing, CSV) and ARE tracked; likewise results/timing/
# (real plots). Only the power-axis simulated/regenerable files below are
# ignored -- the patterns are non-recursive on purpose, so they don't touch
# the timing/ subdirectories.
traces/*.npz
results/*.png
__pycache__/
